            "sid": "REV 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abandi boonaboona, abataitibwa bibamba bino, baaloba kwenenia mu ebyo bye baakolanga: Baaloba kuleka okusinza emizimu emibi n'ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda bye baakola mu zaabu, ni mu feeza, ni mu kyuma eky'ekikomo, ni mu mabaale, ni mu miti, ebitasobola kubona oba kuwulira oba kutambula.",
          "type": "text",
